          <commentary>V₂ = 2 × 2.5 ÷ 4 = 1.25 m³이고, (2 - 1.25) ÷ 2 × 100 = 37.5%이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
