    <question_explanation no="16" id="PRB-A7334708B95ED5C7-Q16">
      <question_stem>다음 분석 결과를 가진 시료의 SAR은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>분석</keyword>
        <keyword>결과</keyword>
        <keyword>가진</keyword>
        <keyword>시료</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>2.0</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 환경공학개론 · 나트륨 흡착비
정답은 ③이다. 각 이온을 meq/L로 환산하면 Ca²⁺ 100 ÷ 20 = 5, Mg²⁺ 36.6 ÷ 12.2 = 3, Na⁺ 92 ÷ 23 = 4이다. SAR = Na⁺ ÷ √[(Ca²⁺ + Mg²⁺)/2] = 4 ÷ √(8/2) = 4 ÷ 2 = 2.0이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.5</choice_text>
          <commentary>0.5는 계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>1.2</choice_text>
          <commentary>1.2는 계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>2.0</choice_text>
          <commentary>Ca²⁺ 5, Mg²⁺ 3, Na⁺ 4 meq/L이므로 SAR = 4 ÷ √(8/2) = 2.0이어서 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>3.6</choice_text>
          <commentary>3.6은 계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
